-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Payan</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Kitamura</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Nolan</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Lorens</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Activation of the PKB/AKT pathway by ICAM-2</article-title><source>Immunity</source><year>2002</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>51</fpage><lpage>65</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Immunity||16|51||bib26|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11825565</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Plowright</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergsagel</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Chesi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Barber</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Branch</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Hawley</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Stewart</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ectopic expression of fibroblast growth factor receptor 3 promotes myeloma cell proliferation and prevents apoptosis</article-title><source>Blood</source><year>2000</year><volume>95</volume><fpage>992</fpage><lpage>998</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Blood||95|992||bib27|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10648414</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Staunton</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Dustin</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Springer</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Functional cloning of ICAM-2, a cell adhesion ligand for LFA-1 homologous to ICAM-1</article-